  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A community Center for &amp; with refugees in Greece</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">We combat social exclusion and poverty in urban contexts with a longterm, sustainable and comprehensive approach. Our center is accessible, supports efforts of integration as well as emergency support on a drop-in basis and promotes social inclusion through community-building, participation, and holistic support services. Via collaboration and open communal spaces, we promote interaction, idea development, relationship-building &amp; appropriate services to empower people seeking refuge.</narrative>
  </description>
